# EPISODE 1

EPISODE 1.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CHAPTER 1

EPISODE 1: Episode 1. CHAPTER 1.1 — Chapter 1.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The ancient grove shudders. A darkness creeps through the
roots, twisting all it touches.

The camera finds them — closer now.

A beat.

                      STUMPEY
                (scared)
          Big problems... we oughtta get outta
          here.

                      LADY
                (whispering)
          What is happening to the forest? I
          can feel it dying.

                      DOC
                (quietly, to himself)
          Something has poisoned the
          heartwood. There is no curing this
          from here.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
          Less talking, more running! North,
          through the old pass!

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Right. Stay close everyone. Move!

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY. REACH THE OLD ROAD (NORTH) — The old road. Nobody's used it in ages.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CHAPTER 1 - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      STUMPEY
                (whispering)
          We made it...

                      LADY
                (scared)
          But look behind us...

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      DOC
                (quietly, to himself)
          All those towers... everything we
          built. Gone.

A beat.

                      GOBLIN
          No use cryin' about it. What's
          ahead?

                      STUMPEY
          The old road. Nobody's used it in
          ages.

The party turns north, leaving the corrupted grove behind.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CHAPTER 2

EPISODE 1: Episode 1. CHAPTER 1.2 — Chapter 2.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A beat.

The old road opens onto another clearing. Watchtowers hold
the shoulders. Something is already marching.

ANGLE ON STUMPEY.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Towers left and right. Do not stop.

A beat.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY. TAKE THE NORTH RIDGE (EXIT) — Ridge is clear. Keep north.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CHAPTER 2 - LATER

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      DOC
          Ridge is clear. Something still
          pulls north.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CHAPTER 3

EPISODE 1: Episode 1. CHAPTER 1.3 — Chapter 3.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A beat.

The ridge drops into a last hollow. The road ends in open
dirt.

ANGLE ON STUMPEY.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
          That bright patch. That is the door.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Then we walk it. No more looking
          back.

A beat.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY. REACH THE CLEAN HOLLOW (EXIT) — The road is done.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CHAPTER 3 - LATER

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      LADY
          The blight cannot reach us here.

A beat.

The party stands on clean ground. This road is done.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

